Z||000020||stsmithgt||06-07-2000||02:24 PM||||Speaking up multiple colors of paint.  If you can't make up your mind, try something like that flip-flop paint.  Holographic, camileon paint. What ever you want to call it.  It comes in several combinations of colors on it.  My brother used the Red/Blue combo with other graphics on his motorcycle.  Other colors also show up depending on the angle of the light and where you are standing.  It looks cool when the sides look blue and the top looks gold and the front looks purple and the back looks red....Oh wait I moved. now it looks different.  It's a definate attention grabber.  It came in second place last year in a hollister motorcycle show which consists mostly of Harleys.  His is a Kawasaki ZX-6. Oops, I put in more than my 2 cents. I'm off <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||10
